  "description": "<p><em>Artefact (a tome).</em> An evil creature who reads it for a week gains 2 to one attribute (up to 22). After that, its holder has <strong>Advantage</strong> on saves against good effects and <strong>once per day</strong> may cast <em>energy drain</em> or <em>create undead</em>.</p><p><strong>Drawback:</strong> a good creature who reads a page makes a <strong>Will save</strong> or its Outlook turns evil.</p><p><strong>Destroyed:</strong> soaked for a year in the tears of a good deity&#x27;s servant.</p><p class=\"arn-note\">Monsters &amp; Treasure, Artefacts. Its save DC is 20 unless the entry says otherwise.</p>",
